    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pirates</strong> is a swashbuckling action-adventure where you play as <strong>James Flint</strong>, a sailor thrown into a fight against the cursed Captain Blackwood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your companion <strong>Clara</strong> is taken by Blackwood\u2019s crew, you set sail across dangerous seas and treacherous islands to find her\u2014before his dark ambitions can be fulfilled. Battle ruthless pirates, uncover secrets on handcrafted islands, hunt for treasure, and discover powerful relics in this byte-sized high-seas adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Set sail into the unknown, travel to other islands, avoid hazards on the water, and discover ancient mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land Combat\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Duel skeleton pirates, crabs, and sea urchins (with more enemy types in the works!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naval Combat\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Fire your cannons against opposition, and break apart Blackwood's defenses one piece at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunts &amp; Puzzles\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Discover tools that grant you new abilities, uncover and decode cryptic riddles, and platform your way to treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Upgrades &amp; Customization\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0 Upgrade your ship with stronger sails that will increase your ship's speed, reinforce your hull to take less damage, or simply purchase from a set of flags to personalize your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests</strong> - Accept and complete quests to move the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading</strong> \u2013 Find and trade with merchants to give you an edge in combat, or simply resupply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate's Gambit</strong> - Play a turn-based strategy minigame called Pirate's Gambit, where you'll perform various actions to attack or defend, using your stamina as a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>rise to the challenge</strong> and put an end to <strong>Captain Blackwood\u2019s reign of terror?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become <strong>just another shipwreck in the tide?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to set sail. Adventure awaits!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pirates</strong> is a swashbuckling action-adventure where you play as <strong>James Flint</strong>, a sailor thrown into a fight against the cursed Captain Blackwood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your companion <strong>Clara</strong> is taken by Blackwood\u2019s crew, you set sail across dangerous seas and treacherous islands to find her\u2014before his dark ambitions can be fulfilled. Battle ruthless pirates, uncover secrets on handcrafted islands, hunt for treasure, and discover powerful relics in this byte-sized high-seas adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Set sail into the unknown, travel to other islands, avoid hazards on the water, and discover ancient mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land Combat\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Duel skeleton pirates, crabs, and sea urchins (with more enemy types in the works!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naval Combat\u00a0\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Fire your cannons against opposition, and break apart Blackwood's defenses one piece at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunts &amp; Puzzles\u00a0</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Discover tools that grant you new abilities, uncover and decode cryptic riddles, and platform your way to treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Upgrades &amp; Customization\u00a0</strong>\u2013\u00a0 Upgrade your ship with stronger sails that will increase your ship's speed, reinforce your hull to take less damage, or simply purchase from a set of flags to personalize your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests</strong> - Accept and complete quests to move the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading</strong> \u2013 Find and trade with merchants to give you an edge in combat, or simply resupply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirate's Gambit</strong> - Play a turn-based strategy minigame called Pirate's Gambit, where you'll perform various actions to attack or defend, using your stamina as a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you <strong>rise to the challenge</strong> and put an end to <strong>Captain Blackwood\u2019s reign of terror?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become <strong>just another shipwreck in the tide?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to set sail. Adventure awaits!</strong></p>",
